                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "ACA Tax credits expire at the end of the month. If Congress doesn\u2019t take action, health care costs will skyrocket for everyone.\n\nRepublicans may not have a plan, but Democrats do.\u00a0\n\nI signed a discharge petition that will force a vote to extend these critical health insurance tax credits for three years.\n\nWe only need 4 Republicans to get on board",
