                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I held a hearing at Queens College on federal funding for STEM programs in New York\u2014and how the Administration\u2019s cuts are hurting Queens.\n\nSTEM programs educate the next generation and drive progress in health care, technology, and scientific research. These cuts threaten the innovations our community depends on.\n\nA special thank you to New York Hall of Science, Queensborough Community College, New York University, Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center, Cornell University, Intrepid Museum and Columbia University for joining this conversation.\n\nWatching the full hearing on YouTube: https://t.co/xULq5fipak",
