                "text": "Democrats are once again ready to pass a bill that extends ACA tax credits and prevents everyone\u2019s premiums skyrocketing in the new year.\n\nRepublicans have joined us to force a vote on our plan to extend these health insurance tax credits for three years.\n\nSpeaker Johnson, let\u2019s bring this bill to the floor TODAY!",
